# ============================================================================
# PolyNotes Environment Configuration (.env.example)
# ============================================================================
# IMPORTANT FOR PUBLIC SHARING:
# - Keep all variables below COMMENTED OUT in .env.example so the Android
#   build never packages any secrets into the APK and public sharing remains
#   unrestricted.
# - Server-side secrets (GEMINI_API_KEY) are read exclusively at runtime by
#   the Node.js backend proxy (backend/proxy-server.js) via process.env.
# ============================================================================

# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# EXTERNAL_API_KEY=
# PORT=8787
